  "reason": "The assistant directly contradicts the provided reference by asserting that the same 0.5‰ limit applies to all drivers regardless of experience, whereas the reference explicitly states that a stricter 0.10‰ limit applies to probationary licence holders, learner drivers, their accompanying persons, driving instructors at work, professional transport drivers, and certain heavy vehicles."
  "evidence": "In der Schweiz gelten für alle Fahrzeuglenker, unabhängig von ihrer Fahrerfahrung, dieselben gesetzlichen Promillegrenzen."
